+      <t indent="0" pn="section-3-4">There are other RFCs that update <xref target="RFC6625" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC6625"/> and modify the rules for finding a &quot;match for reception&quot;.  See, e.g., <xref target="RFC7582" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC7582"/> and <xref target="RFC7900" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC7900"/>.  When applying those modified rules, it is <bcp14>REQUIRED</bcp14> to ignore any S-PMSI A-D route that has no PTA, or whose PTA specifies &quot;no tunnel information present&quot;.</t>
